	(text "Display-only receiver per POS line (README 3.2): 33k pull-down + 100k/18k divider = 25.8 kOhm, about 0.93 mA at 24 V.\nGate = 0.153 x pin voltage: 2.4 V -> 0.37 V (off, BSS138 Vth >= 0.8 V); 18 V -> 2.75 V (on).  AO3401A Vgs = -24 x 4.7/14.7 = -7.7 V.\nEach P-MOSFET feeds the coil bus <D>BC<b> of the 1/1/2/4/5 tree relays of that bit (and the bit lamp)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "85fe9176-adf5-52ea-9b7f-4b9e2d9cf188")
	)
